	)
	(text "SCALE TRIMS  (RV1, RV2: Bourns TC33X-2-102E, 1k, LCSC C719174)\nBoth wired as rheostats, wiper tied to the grounded end:\na lifted wiper fails to full 1k (scale shifts, never opens).\nRV1 raises RLO (pin 4) ~50 mV to cancel the detector idle offset\n(bench: ~240 ohm). RV2 + R13 (2.2k) set RHI (pin 6), 2.2k-3.2k.\nC8 at pin 4, returned to the pin 2 star ground.\nKeep pins 7/8 load capacitance < 0.05 uF (no bypass on REF).\nCAL (1 kHz sine, check generator DC offset first):\n  1. RV1: -20 dB lamp just lights at 0.347 Vpp; dark at idle.\n  2. RV2: 0 dB lamp just lights at 3.474 Vpp.\n  3. Recheck step 1 (weak interaction)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 237.744 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "671a6041-3b0f-42fd-bcb3-520a54ef75c3")
	)
	(text "C4/C5 decouple U2 (pins 8 and 4). U2 must be a B part (LM393B/LM2903B):\n+/-15 V is 30 V total, the non-B recommended maximum."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 96.52 166.37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6a1d2f4b-77c3-4e19-8b2a-000000000064")
	)
	(text "DETECTOR  (LM3916 datasheet Fig. 3, modified)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6a1d2f4b-77c3-4e19-8b2a-000000000065")
	)
	(text "PEAK LED"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6a1d2f4b-77c3-4e19-8b2a-000000000066")
	)
	(text "Detector: Fig. 3 half-wave peak detector. D1 replaced by Q2, a diode-connected 2N3906 (E = anode, B + C = cathode),\nso its drop tracks Q1's base-emitter drop. R14 pulls Q1's emitter up from +15 V. R15 gives Q1's base current a DC path\n(a floating input lifts the reading by I_B x R15). C1 charges through R14; release ~ (R18 + R19) x C1 ~ 0.66 s.\nR17 limits LM3916 pin 5 current when the envelope exceeds the 5 V rail.\n\nPeak LED: U2A trips when AUDIO_IN > +15 V x R20/(R22 + R20) = +6.0 V, U2B when AUDIO_IN < -15 V x R24/(R23 + R24) = -6.0 V,\ni.e. ~12 Vpp sine, either polarity. Their open-collector outputs are tied together and pull H (C3, referenced to +5 V) low through D1;\nC3 then discharges through R21 into PNP Q3's base, so the LED fades out over ~0.5 s. R25 keeps the idle output node from pulling H.\n\nSupplies: +5 V (LM3916, LEDs) ~70 mA at full scale; +15 V (R14, R22/R20, U2) ~0.6 mA; -15 V (U2) ~0.2 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6a1d2f4b-77c3-4e19-8b2a-000000000067")
	)
	(text "CLIP  red"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 349.885 45.085 0)
